    "updated": "Last updated: 31 October 2026",
    "intro": "Kaartscore is a score app for card games with friends. We respect your privacy and collect as little data as possible.",
    "dataTitle": "What data?",
    "dataBody": "You enter player names and scores yourself. That data stays only on your device, in the browser or app memory, for as long as the game is running.",
